SCOPE

This license covers only the source code in this repository. No model weights,
audio, or benchmark data are distributed here, and none of the following are
covered by it. Each carries its own terms, which you are responsible for
reviewing before use:

  - Qwen2-Audio-7B-Instruct and Audio Flamingo 3 model weights, obtained from
    their respective model cards. Audio Flamingo 3 is licensed for
    non-commercial research use.
  - The Audio Hallucination benchmark (AH Existence, Order, and Attribute) and
    the CompA recordings that two of its tasks are built on.
  - Clotho-AQA and the FreeSound recordings it annotates.

See the Setup section of README.md for where each is obtained.
